{"id":"1f166040771c1b1d","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-ggm-prf.md","title":"GGM从倍长生成器构造伪随机函数","display":"thm-ggm-prf — GGM从倍长生成器构造伪随机函数","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-ggm-prf","aliases":["28-thm-ggm-prf"],"display":"thm-ggm-prf — GGM从倍长生成器构造伪随机函数","depends_on":["[[28-df-prg]]","[[28-df-prf]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 9.17 and proof","source_printed_pages":"190–191","source_pdf_pages":"216–217","source_status":"statement-compared-proof-not-fully-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-ggm-prf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-ggm-prf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ggm-prf — GGM从倍长生成器构造伪随机函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"10640aec74cc5cc9\" href=\"?note=10640aec74cc5cc9\" title=\"28-df-prg\">28-df-prg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"07cea5d2f4c7fcf2\" href=\"?note=07cea5d2f4c7fcf2\" title=\"28-df-prf\">28-df-prf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 9.17 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"190–191"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"216–217"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-proof-not-fully-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(0)=1\">\\(d(0)=1\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(n)=2n\">\\(d(n)=2n\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall s\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|G(s)|=d(|s|)\">\\(\\forall s\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|G(s)|=d(|s|)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRG}(G,d)\">\\(\\operatorname{PRG}(G,d)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"10640aec74cc5cc9\" href=\"?note=10640aec74cc5cc9\" title=\"28-df-prg\">28-df-prg</a> 的均匀PPT量词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRF}\">\\(\\operatorname{PRF}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"07cea5d2f4c7fcf2\" href=\"?note=07cea5d2f4c7fcf2\" title=\"28-df-prf\">28-df-prf</a> 的自适应多项式时间预言机区分器。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(n)=\\max\\{1,n\\}\">\\(m(n)=\\max\\{1,n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(F:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_b:\\Sigma^+\\to\\Sigma^+\">\\(G_b:\\Sigma^+\\to\\Sigma^+\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>）将在下式按切片定义；字串下标从1开始，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^+=\\Sigma^*\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}\">\\(\\Sigma^+=\\Sigma^*\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_b(s)\\coloneqq G(s)_{b|s|+1}\\cdots G(s)_{(b+1)|s|}\\qquad(s\\in\\Sigma^+,\\ b\\in\\{0,1\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_b(s)\\coloneqq G(s)_{b|s|+1}\\cdots G(s)_{(b+1)|s|}\\qquad(s\\in\\Sigma^+,\\ b\\in\\{0,1\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z_0(k,x)\\coloneqq k,\\qquad z_i(k,x)\\coloneqq G_{x_i}(z_{i-1}(k,x))\\quad(k,x\\in\\Sigma^n,\\ n\\ge1,\\ 1\\le i\\le n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z_0(k,x)\\coloneqq k,\\qquad z_i(k,x)\\coloneqq G_{x_i}(z_{i-1}(k,x))\\quad(k,x\\in\\Sigma^n,\\ n\\ge1,\\ 1\\le i\\le n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F(k,x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}z_n(k,x)&amp;|k|=|x|=n\\ge1,\\\\0&amp;k=\\varepsilon,\\ |x|=1,\\\\\\varepsilon&amp;(|k|=0\\land|x|\\ne1)\\lor(|k|&gt;0\\land|x|\\ne|k|).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F(k,x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}z_n(k,x)&amp;|k|=|x|=n\\ge1,\\\\0&amp;k=\\varepsilon,\\ |x|=1,\\\\\\varepsilon&amp;(|k|=0\\land|x|\\ne1)\\lor(|k|&gt;0\\land|x|\\ne|k|).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRG}(G,d)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{PRF}(F;m,m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PRG}(G,d)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{PRF}(F;m,m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>沿输入比特x_i选择G的左右半部，密钥是树根；不能误用密钥比特作为分支标签。已渲染核对印刷p.190/PDFp.216：原书式(9.10)字面以密钥比特作分支、以输入x作初值，但同页图9.2及紧接的树解释都以密钥k为根、以输入x定位叶；本条依该图与树解释采用后者，不把修正后的递归冒充式(9.10)的字面转写。n≥1正是书中倍长构造。当前PRG谓词要求所有n都有严格伸长，PRF要求正的输入/输出长度，故单独给n=0长度1和常量值；有限初始项不改变可忽略优势。安全论证依赖按至多多项式查询访问的树节点逐项混合替换，每一步若有可检测差别便区分G(U_n)与U_{2n}。此次核对该混合论证的结构与量词，未完整重建自适应查询模拟及定量界，故不作为已核验依赖。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 9.17 and proof；印刷 pp.190–191 / PDF pp.216–217。本次核对范围：对应陈述；证明边界见本节，未升级为完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-prg","status":"resolved","id":"10640aec74cc5cc9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-prg]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-prf","status":"resolved","id":"07cea5d2f4c7fcf2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-prf]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-prg","status":"resolved","id":"10640aec74cc5cc9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$，$d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 满足 $d(0)=1$ 且 $d(n)=2n$ 对 $n\\ge1$，$\\forall s\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|G(s)|=d(|s|)$；$\\operatorname{PRG}(G,d)$ 采用 [[28-df-prg]] 的均匀PPT量词。$\\operatorname{PRF}$ 采用 [[28-df-prf]] 的自适应多项式时间预言机区分器。$m(n)=\\max\\{1,n\\}$；$F:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$。$G_b:\\Sigma^+\\to\\Sigma^+$（$b\\in\\{0,1\\}$）将在下式按切片定义；字串下标从1开始，$\\Sigma^+=\\Sigma^*\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-prf","status":"resolved","id":"07cea5d2f4c7fcf2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$，$d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 满足 $d(0)=1$ 且 $d(n)=2n$ 对 $n\\ge1$，$\\forall s\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|G(s)|=d(|s|)$；$\\operatorname{PRG}(G,d)$ 采用 [[28-df-prg]] 的均匀PPT量词。$\\operatorname{PRF}$ 采用 [[28-df-prf]] 的自适应多项式时间预言机区分器。$m(n)=\\max\\{1,n\\}$；$F:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$。$G_b:\\Sigma^+\\to\\Sigma^+$（$b\\in\\{0,1\\}$）将在下式按切片定义；字串下标从1开始，$\\Sigma^+=\\Sigma^*\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"d(0)=1","display":false},{"tex":"d(n)=2n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall s\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|G(s)|=d(|s|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PRG}(G,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PRF}","display":false},{"tex":"m(n)=\\max\\{1,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"G_b:\\Sigma^+\\to\\Sigma^+","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^+=\\Sigma^*\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}","display":false},{"tex":"G_b(s)\\coloneqq G(s)_{b|s|+1}\\cdots G(s)_{(b+1)|s|}\\qquad(s\\in\\Sigma^+,\\ b\\in\\{0,1\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"z_0(k,x)\\coloneqq k,\\qquad z_i(k,x)\\coloneqq G_{x_i}(z_{i-1}(k,x))\\quad(k,x\\in\\Sigma^n,\\ n\\ge1,\\ 1\\le i\\le n).","display":true},{"tex":"F(k,x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}z_n(k,x)&|k|=|x|=n\\ge1,\\\\0&k=\\varepsilon,\\ |x|=1,\\\\\\varepsilon&(|k|=0\\land|x|\\ne1)\\lor(|k|>0\\land|x|\\ne|k|).\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PRG}(G,d)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{PRF}(F;m,m).","display":true}],"bytes":2721,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-317","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-perfect-secrecy]]、[[28-ex-one-time-pad]]、[[28-thm-perfect-secrecy-key-bound]]、[[28-df-one-way-permutation]]、[[28-thm-ggm-prf]]、[[28-prop-one-time-pad-key-reuse]]。"}],"outgoing":["10640aec74cc5cc9","07cea5d2f4c7fcf2"]}